C2.2 – Ciberseguridad y ciberdefensa
   - Definition: Determines whether the document promotes the development or use of AI for cybersecurity and cyberdefense purposes.
   - Options:
       * "Promueve el desarrollo de IA para prevenir ciberataques" → The document includes measures to develop or use AI for cybersecurity, preventing cyberattacks, or cyberdefense
       * "No promueve el desrrollo de IA para prevenir ciberataques" → The document does not mention using AI for cybersecurity or cyberdefense
   - Decision rule: Look for sections mentioning:
     - Cybersecurity ("ciberseguridad", "seguridad digital", "seguridad informática")
     - Cyberdefense ("ciberdefensa", "defensa cibernética")
     - Prevention of cyberattacks ("prevención de ciberataques", "protección contra ataques")
     - Security measures ("medidas de seguridad", "protección de sistemas")
     - Use of AI for security purposes
     If such measures exist → choose "Promueve el desarrollo de IA para prevenir ciberataques"
     If absent → choose "No promueve el desrrollo de IA para prevenir ciberataques"
   - Key indicators: Articles mentioning cybersecurity, cyberdefense, prevention of cyberattacks, or use of AI for security purposes
 
